{"time": 1758383310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015341964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "703302925", "user_id": "3994098582"}, "sender": {"id": "3994098582", "name": "虚饰艾玛"}, "message": "总之，艾玛跟了上去，然后一直跟到三楼一间没有被使用的教室"}
{"time": 1758383388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077917640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "703302925", "user_id": "3994098582"}, "sender": {"id": "3994098582", "name": "虚饰艾玛"}, "message": "你看到那名男学生被推进了教室，然后教室门就这么关上了，艾玛就只能看着这一切的发生（）"}
{"time": 1758383427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11612417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "703302925", "user_id": "3994098582"}, "sender": {"id": "3994098582", "name": "虚饰艾玛"}, "message": "那么，先切到雪莉那里吧"}
{"time": 1758383453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413471218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "703302925", "user_id": "2521841432"}, "sender": {"id": "2521841432", "name": "南瓜蛋糕（已黑化）"}, "message": "（无能的艾玛）"}
{"time": 1758383462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048307465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "703302925", "user_id": "3994098582"}, "sender": {"id": "3994098582", "name": "虚饰艾玛"}, "message": "雪莉正在自习，同样注意到操场的雾气，不过教室里倒没什么特别的反应，大家都好爱学习呢（）"}
{"time": 1758383481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674897979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "703302925", "user_id": "3994098582"}, "sender": {"id": "3994098582", "name": "虚饰艾玛"}, "message": "这时，一名男学生突然接到了一个电话，然后说了句“我这就过来”就打算离开教室"}
{"time": 1758383488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239588467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "703302925", "user_id": "3994098582"}, "sender": {"id": "3994098582", "name": "虚饰艾玛"}, "message": "你可以跟上去（）"}
